c","site_admin":false}},{"sha":"199205baeee79595520df6de0c29f0a583e2514d","node_id":"C_kwDOS9rTN9oAKDE5OTIwNWJhZWVlNzk1OTU1MjBkZjZkZTBjMjlmMGE1ODNlMjUxNGQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cogni-dao/red/git/commits/199205baeee79595520df6de0c29f0a583e2514d","html_url":"https://github.com/cogni-dao/red/commit/199205baeee79595520df6de0c29f0a583e2514d","author":{"name":"Derek","email":"derekgranito@gmail.com","date":"2026-06-19T16:57:52Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-06-19T16:57:52Z"},"tree":{"sha":"683c7f8077a786cbb6911c1ed19607f5bd640c67","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cogni-dao/red/git/trees/683c7f8077a786cbb6911c1ed19607f5bd640c67"},"message":"feat(knowledge): unblock bearer-agent reads (port operator #1461 + extend to graph/domains) (#49)\n\nBrowse routes 403'd every bearer-token request even though getSessionUser is\nbearer-first and the knowledge.list contract already declares\nKNOWLEDGE_READ_REQUIRES_PRINCIPAL. Agents could WRITE contributions but never\nREAD the plane they wrote to.\n\nOperator fixed this in #1461 for list + [id]; node-template never got the port,\nand operator never finished domains (still cookie-only) or graph (node-only feature).\n\nThis removes the bearer-403 guard on all four read routes:\n- GET /knowledge (list)        — mirrors operator #1461\n- GET /knowledge/[id]          — mirrors operator #1461\n- GET /knowledge/graph         — node-only; agents can now pull citation links\n- GET /knowledge/domains (list) — extends past operator\n\nInvariant KNOWLEDGE_BROWSE_VIA_HTTP_REQUIRES_SESSION -> KNOWLEDGE_READ_REQUIRES_PRINCIPAL\n(DOMAIN_LIST_COOKIE_ONLY -> DOMAIN_LIST_REQUIRES_PRINCIPAL). Human-UI fetchers\nstay cookie-only by construction. Adds a contract test proving bearer agents\nget 200 (not 403) on all four routes incl. graph edge link-pulling.\n\nFull-text search remains a gap (port exposes only list/get, no query).","parents":[{"sha":"a194d971fa2858925a74ffabcc3a71cf4a53a4c5","url":"